===Etymology===
{{suffix|de|Hanf|ling}}

The bird was so called for its fondness for hemp seeds (cf. English {{m|en|linnet}})

The colloquial usage for a person is by comparison to a hemp plant (cf. English {{m|en|beanpole}})

